MENTOR: Yes. **Layer > Transform > Center Anchor Point in Layer Content** moves the pivot to the layer's center without moving the layer. Door's pivot is already at its center, though, and you want it on the middle of its left edge. That menu command only does the center, so for this one use Pan Behind (Y) and drag the crosshair over to the left edge.

Say "done" when you've set it.

